          "from": "Old Spanish mugier /muˈʒeɾ/ 'woman'",
          "to": "/muˈʃeɾ/ (16th c.), later mujer /muˈxeɾ/",
          "note": "Voiced sibilants devoiced; /ʒ/ merged with /ʃ/."
        }
      ]
    }
